@title Cabinet: Rails and ducts refuses a duct turn that would lie over another duct
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson-t-junctions.novo: Place all result, row ducts end against the trunk's side. Turning
# the first row duct (545 mm) upright would put it over the trunk: the edit is refused with a message and the
# duct stays as it was. Pictures: the list, after the refused turn.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson-t-junctions.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
click_text "Rails and ducts"
wait 10
shot list
click 713 493
wait 10
expect "A duct cannot lie over"
shot refused
check_layout
